Across multiple clinical trials, tirzepatide is demonstrated as follows: • substantial weight reduction, often ≥20% in obesity studies [ 14 , 30 ]; • significant HbA1c reduction in T2D [ 13 , 22 , 26 ]; • improvements in lipid profile and insulin sensitivity [ 12 , 15 , 20 ].

